  "details": "For safety purposes, I think Portal Prompt should be enabled by default. Although it may \"break immersion\", the benefits it gives to people by preventing them from accidentally going through portals, especially near teleport areas in worlds, is huge.\n\nMany new players (and even many experienced players) don't know about this toggle as well, so perhaps making it more prominent in the menu (or creating a Loading Screen tooltip for it) would be helpful as well.",
